  <block id="fda3cce0ad94905cc7b862e48ea5b42f" category="paragraph">新的缓存出现在缓存列表中。缓存卷名称将显示<block ref="2688da00ef40aea51d0332942162f4a3" prefix=" " category="inline-code"></block>作为源卷名称的后缀。</block>
  <block id="1a594c580595e3ee20d748a365fef6b2" category="list-text">要查看操作进度，请从NetApp Console菜单中选择 *管理* &gt; *审核*。</block>
